sequenceDiagram
  title Checkout
  actor C as Customer
  participant W as Web app
  participant P as Payments
  C->>W: Place order
  activate W
  W->>+P: Charge card
  P-->>-W: Approved
  alt in stock
    W-->>C: Order confirmed
  else out of stock
    W-->>C: Refund started
  end
  deactivate W
  Note over C,W: Email receipt sent
